    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="purl:Definition"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo2:OAE_0000034</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">a behavior and neurological AE that has an outcome of fatigue, which is a state of awareness describing a range of afflictions, usually associated with physical and/or mental weakness, though varying from a general state of lethargy to a specific work-induced burning sensation within one&apos;s muscles. Physical fatigue is the inability to continue functioning at the level of one&apos;s normal abilities.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
