        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">a neuropathy AE which shows symptoms due to the damage to the autonomic nerves. This damage disrupts signals between the brain and portions of the autonomic nervous system, such as the heart, blood vessels and sweat glands. This can cause decreased or abnormal performance of one or more involuntary body functions.</Literal>
