        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">According to the Vaccine Adverse Event Reporting System (VAERS),  &apos;sedimentation rate increased&apos; is an adverse event that was mentioned in 530 VAERS reports (0.4%) during1991-2001 (Reference: PMID: 12825543).</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
