        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo2:OAE_0000468</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">a liver/biliary system AE which has an outcome of jaundice, which is the clinical manifestation of hyperbilirubinemia, with deposition of bile pigments in the skin, resulting in yellowish staining of the skin and mucous membranes</Literal>
