        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">multiple sclerosis AE is an immune system disorder AE, or an autoimmune condition in which the immune system attacks the central nervous system, leading to demyelination.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
