        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">According to the Vaccine Adverse Event Reporting System (VAERS), &apos;laryngitis&apos;; is an adverse event that was mentioned in 190 VAERS reports (0.1%) during1991-2001 (Reference: PMID: 12825543).</Literal>
