        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">a muscle spasm AE which has an outcome of generalized spasm, which is an involuntary contraction of a muscle or group of muscles. Spasms may involve skeletal muscle (MUSCLE, SKELETAL) or smooth muscle (MUSCLE, SMOOTH).</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
