        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">facial pain is a pain in facial area (eyes, eyebrows, forehead, nose, cheeks, mouth, teeth and chin). Facial pain may include injuries to the nerves or bones that coordinate many of your face’s actions.</Literal>
