        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">hyporeflexia is the condition of below normal or absent reflexes. Hyporeflexia is generally associated with a lower motor neuron deficit (at the alpha motor neurons from the spinal cord to muscle).</Literal>
