        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">a pneumonia AE that occurs at the interstitial lung. Interstitial pneumonia is often caused by an infection of bacteria, viruses, or fungii. A bacterium called Mycoplasma pneumonia is the most common cause.</Literal>
