        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">Skin necrosis AE is a necrosis AE that results in the death of the skin tissue. Skin necrosis often occurs when not enough blood and oxygen are supplied to a given skin region.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
