    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="purl:Definition"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo2:OAE_0001856</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">Systemic lupus erythematosus (SLE) syndrome AE is a lupus syndrome AE that is systemic and disseminated. SLE most often harms the heart, joints, skin, lungs, blood vessels, liver, kidneys, and nervous system. Although “lupus” actually includes a number of different diseases, SLE is the most common type of lupus, and when people say “lupus,” they are often referring to SLE. </Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
