        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">Ankle swelling AE is an edema AE that shows abnormal buildup of fluid in the ankles. Ankle swelling is a sign of fluid buildup or inflammation of the joint and tissues of the ankle. Mild ankle swelling is a common occurrence after standing for a long period.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
