        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">Renal dysfunction AE is a kidney AE that has an outcome of reduced capacity to excrete metabolic products which accumulate systemically and are detectable clinicopathologically by renal function tests. The early stage of uremia.</Literal>
