        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">Epiphora AE is a eye AE that shows an overflow of tears onto the face. In this case, there is insufficient tear film drainage from the eyes, and the tears will drain down the face rather than through the nasolacrimal system.</Literal>
