        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">Cholelithiasis AE is a liver, biliary, and pancreatic AE that shows hard deposits forming inside the gallbladder. Gallstones may be as small as a grain of sand or as large as a golf ball.</Literal>
