        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">Non-insulin-dependent diabetes mellitus AE is a diabetes mellitus AE which is also called diabetes mellitus type 2, it&apos;s characterized by hyperglycemia (high blood sugar) in the context of insulin resistance and relative lack of insulin.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
