        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">Insulin dependent diabetes mellitus AE is a diabetes mellitus AE which is also called diabetes mellitus type 1. It results from the autoimmune destruction of the insulin-producing beta cells in the pancreas.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
