        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">Pitting edema AE is an edema AE that shows observable swelling of body tissues due to fluid accumulation that may be demonstrated by applying pressure to the swollen area (such as by depressing the skin with a finger).</Literal>
