        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="purl:Definition"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo2:OAE_0001938</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">Clouding of consciousness AE is a sensory capability AE that is a term used in conventional medicine denoting an abnormality in the &quot;regulation&quot; of the &quot;overall level&quot; of consciousness that is mild and less severe than a delirium. The sufferer experiences a subjective sensation of mental clouding described as feeling &quot;foggy&quot;.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
