        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="purl:Definition"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo2:OAE_0001952</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">Polymyalgia rheumatica AE is a muscle pain AE that is a syndrome with pain or stiffness, usually in the neck, shoulders, and hips. The pain can be very sudden, or can occur gradually over a period. It may be caused by an inflammatory condition of blood vessels such as temporal arteritis.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
