        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">Sinus bradycardia AE is a bradycardia AE that is a heart rhythm that originates from the sinus node and has a rate that is lower than normal. In humans, bradycardia is generally defined to be a rate of under 60 beats per minute.</Literal>
