        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">Malabsorption syndrome AE is a digestive system AE that refers to a number of disorders in which the intestine’s ability to absorb certain nutrients, such as vitamin B12 and iron, into the bloodstream is negatively affected.</Literal>
