        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">Parkinson&apos;s disease AE is a neurological AE that is a degenerative disorder of the central nervous system. The motor symptoms of Parkinson&apos;s disease result from the death of dopamine-generating cells in the substantia nigra, a region of the midbrain, the cause of this cell death is unknown.</Literal>
