        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">Urinary calculus AE a urinary system AE that is solid particles in the urinary system. They may cause pain, nausea, vomiting, hematuria, and, possibly, chills and fever due to secondary infection.</Literal>
