        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">Hyperthyroidism AE is an endocrine system AE that is a condition in which the thyroid gland produces and secretes excessive amounts of the free (not protein bound circulating in the blood) thyroid hormones -triiodothyronine (T3) and/or thyroxine (T4).</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
