        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">Priapism AE a male reproductive system AE that is a potentially painful medical condition in which the erect penis does not return to its flaccid state, despite the absence of both physical and psychological stimulation, within four hours.</Literal>
