        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">Hypochloremic alkalosis AE is a blood chloride decreased AE that is a medical condition in which the patient&apos;s body has abnormally low levels of chloride. This condition usually results from an extremely high loss of chloride, rather than a low intake of it.</Literal>
