        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo2:OAE_0002108</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">Carcinogenesis AE is a tumor AE that is literally the &apos;creation&apos; of cancer. It is a process by which normal cells are transformed into cancer cells.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
