        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">Allergic hepatitis AE is a hepatitis AE that is a tissue-specific inflammatory diease caused by hepersensitivity to a particular drug, accomopanied by a systemic allergic reaction such as eosinophilia.</Literal>
