        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo2:OAE_0002116</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">Thrombotic thrombocytopenic purpura AE is a thrombocytopenic purpura AE that is a rare disorder of the blood-coagulation system, causing extensive microscopic clots to form in the small blood vessels throughout the body.</Literal>
