        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">Glaucoma AE is an eye AE that is a term describing a group of ocular (eye) disorders resulting in optic nerve damage or loss to the field of vision, in many patients caused by a clinically characterized pressure buildup in regards to the fluid of the eye (intraocular pressure-associated optic neuropathy).</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
