        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">High hypodynamia AE is a fatigue AE that is a state of awareness describing a range of afflictions, usually associated with physical and/or mental weakness, though varying from a general state of lethargy to a specific work-induced burning sensation within one&apos;s muscles. Physical fatigue is the inability to continue functioning at the level of one&apos;s normal abilities.</Literal>
