        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">Conjugate gaze palsy AE is a gaze palsy AE that is a disorder affecting the ability to move both eyes in the same direction. These palsies can affect gaze in a horizontal, upward, or downward direction.</Literal>
