        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo2:OAE_0002417</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">Posture abnormal AE a behavioral AE that refers to rigid body movements and chronic abnormal positions of the body. This symptom is not the same as showing poor posture or slumping over. Rather, it is often the result of a serious spinal cord or brain injury.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
