        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">cystitis interstitial AE is a cystitis AE that has an outcome of cystitis interstitial, which is a condition that causes discomfort or pain in the bladder and a need to urinate frequently and urgently.</Literal>
