        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">A tendon disorder AE that has an outcome of tendinous which is damage to a tendon at a cellular level. It is thought to be caused by microtears in the connective tissue in and around the tendon, leading to an increase in tendon repair cells.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
