        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">A respiratory distress AE that has an outcome of a newborn dyspnea (i.e., impaired breathing) with cyanosis, most frequently occurring in premature infants, children of diabetic mothers and infants delivered by cesarean section, and sometimes with no predisposing cause.</Literal>
